        1,
        8
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1",
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.carveronthemn.org/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Carver established its Heritage Preservation Commission in 1989, a body that advises the city council on historic preservation.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9,
        11
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
