        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Carver%2C_Minnesota"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "In 2007, the White House honored Carver as a Preserve America Community, recognizing its historic preservation efforts.",
